					Hdt.
					1.126
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθέριος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.8.4
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
