					D.C.
					61.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).146
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					403
				</span></i>
